  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FBF2022 Reaching the furthest behind in Quang Triand Ha Binh province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to address the vulnerabilities of the furthest behind communities in Huong Hoa and Da Krong districts of Quang Tri Province and Da Bac district of Hoa Binh Province by empowering them and improving their access to basic services and livelihoods. Interventions include: livelihoods support, disaster management, women-led business, school support, and small-scale infrastructure, and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
